  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "Ana’s monthly salary was \\(\\$2000\\) in May. In June she received a \\(20\\%\\) raise. In July she received a \\(20\\%\\) pay cut. After the two changes in June and July, Ana’s monthly salary was",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(\\$1920\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\(\\$1980\\)"
    },
